## Verdict

- Novel peptides (1% class FDR): model **446** vs null **374** across 12 populations.
- PC-churn: canonical PSMs 3,284,622 (baseline) -> 3,258,449 (model, -26,173) -> 3,221,135 (null, -63,487). The null DB displaces 37,314 MORE canonical PSMs than the model DB.
- Net PSM: model 3,264,854 vs null 3,232,585.

